        "answer": {
          "short": "$20\\left(\\dfrac12\\right)^k$ g.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}a_{k+1}&=ar^{k}\\\\&=20\\left(\\tfrac12\\right)^k\\text{ g}\\end{align*}$$",
